  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Lady Cold Ash greets him as having arrived early at Ice Crystal grotto-heaven. He answers that they were late, points out variant human Gu Immortals already inside, and says he waited so they could enter together. They leave their immemorial soul beasts and immemorial night heavenly wolves outside the palace hall and enter.",
      "chapters": [
        1969
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lady_cold_ash",
        "loc_ice_crystal_grotto_heaven",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the meeting he returns to Night Wolf grotto-heaven with his wolf group. He tells Ye Zhi he wants human grotto-heavens to advance together and that Central Continent’s Heavenly Court is the most appropriate region to join, while refusing to fight alongside variant humans.",
      "chapters": [
        1970
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "night-wolf-stance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_night_wolf_grotto_heaven",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He decides to defect to the five regions for his own sake and Night Wolf grotto-heaven’s future. Heavenly Court’s Qin Ding Ling sends a secret letter asking him to be their spy; he replies at once that he is willing to cooperate.",
      "chapters": [
        1987
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-spy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_ding_ling"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later narration states outright that he is Heavenly Court’s mole inside Wu Shuai’s alliance.",
      "chapters": [
        2022
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-spy",
